1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,400
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:23,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Here you go. You earned this fair and square, Asta.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,000
What, you don't want it?

6
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,000
No! I do, I do, I do!

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
This is really mine!

8
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Well, what are you waiting for? Let's see how it looks.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
And now, the finishing touch.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Hey! Looks pretty good on you. Right, Yami?

11
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
I don't think it's his color.

12
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
It's official now. You're one of us. You're a member of the Black Bulls.

13
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Don't do anything that would bring shame to Yami, or to the Black Bulls.

14
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Understood! I'm so glad to be a part of this team!

15
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Shut up, kids.

16
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:02,000
I'm so sorry! I'll be more careful from now on, sir!

17
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:06,000
What? Lord, shut up! Do you not understand?

18
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:10,000
So I guess that's the other new recruit.

19
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Little insect.

20
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Little insect.

21
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Little insect.

22
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:40,040
Me

23
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:45,460
Wily na ka no naja na ni ni hitoz kanläwamai

24
00:02:45,460 --> 00:02:48,460
わかってる わかってるんだ

25
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:53,460
獣王無人にどこまでも 羽ばかけたらな

26
00:02:53,460 --> 00:02:55,960
いつの日も夢見てた

27
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:58,460
それでもいっぱいもしかしかな

28
00:02:58,460 --> 00:03:01,460
世界でも何度もか彫り立てる

29
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:04,460
本能のまま諦めしたいからさ

30
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:11,460
遥か未来へ 今駆け出したんだ

31
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:16,460
まだ見ぬ不安さは全て越えて

32
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:21,460
あの日描いた僕が僕であるために

33
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:26,460
いつの日でページの続けがあるよ

34
00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:30,460
君のよう希望と

35
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:33,460
まるでいつかのワンページのような

36
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:35,460
君と僕ら出会えた

37
00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:38,460
これを奇跡って呼ぼうか

38
00:03:41,460 --> 00:03:45,460
聴覧も出来る

39
00:03:53,460 --> 00:03:56,460
angen部屋だ

40
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:57,460
すくないね

41
00:03:57,460 --> 00:03:58,460
みたいさ

42
00:03:58,460 --> 00:03:59,460
そのうちによくなり

43
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,460
フレヲの一番

44
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:01,460
昼を巡っておきます

45
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:03,460
あなたと statutoryした

46
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:04,460
あなたはそれがレベル!!

47
00:04:04,460 --> 00:04:05,460
Develop cerain

48
00:04:05,460 --> 00:04:06,460
おいしいわ

49
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:07,460
お笑いはすぎみ

50
00:04:07,460 --> 00:04:09,460
大ate状況 hélasか

51
00:04:09,460 --> 00:04:11,960
This is the first time I've ever had a space of my own!

52
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:14,760
Back at the church, everybody crammed into one room!

53
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,460
We were all lined up like sardines!

54
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:21,760
So long, dust! Dirt and grime, get out of here!

55
00:04:23,460 --> 00:04:24,760
See ya, cobwebs!

56
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,760
Go on, scrub all you want.

57
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,760
We're free till the next mission, anyway.

58
00:04:30,460 --> 00:04:32,460
Oh, hey, one more thing, Asta.

59
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:33,760
Yeah, what's up?

60
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:35,760
Make sure you take some time to write.

61
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:38,760
The folks back at the church deserve a letter.

62
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:41,460
They're your family, right?

63
00:04:41,460 --> 00:04:43,460
So, they'll want to know that you're okay.

64
00:04:43,460 --> 00:04:44,460
Right!

65
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:47,460
You can't go making anyone worry.

66
00:04:47,460 --> 00:04:49,460
That's what being a real man is all about.

67
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:51,460
Later.

68
00:04:51,460 --> 00:04:53,460
Just hit me up if you need anything.

69
00:04:53,460 --> 00:04:55,460
Will do! Thanks, Magna!

70
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:05,460
This is my first castle, but not my last.

71
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:08,460
Someday, I'm gonna live in the castle of the Wizard King.

72
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:15,460
I won't lose. Got that, Yuno?

73
00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:22,460
It's better than you deserve.

74
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:25,460
A room like this is wasted on the likes of you.

75
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:31,460
Now, tomorrow I'll explain your duties as a magic knight.

76
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:34,460
I don't particularly wish to be your tutor.

77
00:05:34,460 --> 00:05:37,460
But since it's on Captain Vajjan's orders, so be it.

78
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:39,460
Are you listening, boy?

79
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:41,460
My name is Yuno.

80
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:45,460
My name is Yuno, Klaus. Not boy.

81
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:48,460
Enough. Watch your tone.

82
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:52,460
I outrank you. You are to address me as sir.

83
00:05:52,460 --> 00:05:53,460
Yes, sir.

84
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:54,460
Better.

85
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:56,460
Don't be late tomorrow. I will be displeased.

86
00:05:56,460 --> 00:05:57,460
I will be displeased.

87
00:05:57,460 --> 00:05:59,460
I will be displeased.

88
00:05:59,460 --> 00:06:00,460
I will be displeased.

89
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:11,720
...

90
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:20,460
...

91
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:28,080
Thank you.

92
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:41,060
I knew we were right about you, Yuno!

93
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:45,580
The pride and joy of Hajj, making it into the Magic Knights.

94
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:46,720
Not that I'm surprised.

95
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:48,620
Yuno can do anything!

96
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:49,960
Yeah, anything!

97
00:06:50,420 --> 00:06:52,900
Everyone in the village will be so excited when they hear.

98
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:54,900
And what does Asta's letter say?

99
00:06:54,900 --> 00:06:57,940
Can you even make out that terrible chicken scratch of his?

100
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,860
Yeah, he writes like a five-year-old.

101
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,640
So does he say when he's coming home?

102
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:04,380
When he does give here, we'll have to cheer him up.

103
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:07,640
Even Asta will have a hard time bouncing back from this.

104
00:07:08,260 --> 00:07:10,500
Maybe a pot-potato party will lift his spirits.

105
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:13,520
Actually, he says that he got in.

106
00:07:16,420 --> 00:07:19,940
They both passed.

107
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:21,620
What?!

108
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:23,620
Seriously?!

109
00:07:23,620 --> 00:07:25,200
Mm-hmm.

110
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:26,760
Oh, wow.

111
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:28,660
You're not kidding, are you?

112
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:29,600
Really?

113
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:30,640
He did it!

114
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:35,440
So, um, I guess that Asta won't be coming home, will he?

115
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:36,720
Right!

116
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:39,600
We'll go let everyone know about our Magic Knights!

117
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:42,800
This will be the best news Hajj Village has ever gotten to!

118
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:43,560
Amazing!

119
00:07:43,900 --> 00:07:45,960
He's gonna be a Magic Knight just like he said!

120
00:07:46,220 --> 00:07:46,980
He did it!

121
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:49,420
Asta, you know?

122
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:50,600
Good job!

123
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,920
Just keep doing your best!

124
00:07:52,920 --> 00:08:09,280
So it's real, I wasn't dreaming!

125
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:15,960
Right!

126
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:16,660
Yeah!

127
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:17,920
I'm ready to go-

128
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:21,860
Wait a second!

129
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:23,840
I'm pretty sure this column wasn't here yesterday!

130
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:25,220
Hey, newbie!

131
00:08:25,700 --> 00:08:26,420
How's it hanging?

132
00:08:26,980 --> 00:08:28,600
Oh, uh, I'm good, thanks.

133
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:31,220
Can I ask you, though, about this column?

134
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,360
Yeah, what about it?

135
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:36,100
Well, it's just, I don't think it was here yesterday.

136
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:38,200
Probably because it wasn't.

137
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:39,840
That's nothing, though.

138
00:08:39,900 --> 00:08:41,980
This whole building shifts around all the time.

139
00:08:42,220 --> 00:08:43,260
It does?!

140
00:08:43,260 --> 00:08:43,620
Yeah!

141
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,160
Hey, I'll get used to it.

142
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:47,760
I thought there was something weird about this place.

143
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:48,920
Well, come on!

144
00:08:49,140 --> 00:08:49,620
Let's go!

145
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:50,700
Sure thing!

146
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:53,380
You're lucky enough to have me as your tour guide.

147
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:57,080
There's no one better to show you all the secrets of the Black Bull's hideout.

148
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,660
Well, Rasta, ready?

149
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:01,040
Yeah, I'm ready!

150
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:02,500
Let's go, Mr. Shades!

151
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:03,520
What?

152
00:09:04,060 --> 00:09:04,440
No!

153
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,480
It's Sir Twerp!

154
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:06,060
Right!

155
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,380
Got it, Sir Twerp!

156
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:08,800
Drop the Twerp!

157
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,320
This is the dining hall!

158
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:13,320
Ooh!

159
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:15,100
Yeah, what'd you think?

160
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:16,880
Ridiculously huge, huh?

161
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:17,420
No kidding!

162
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:18,040
It's enormous!

163
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:22,080
And this is the communal bath.

164
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,780
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

165
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,460
It's so hot!

166
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:29,500
I mean, maybe it is for a normal person, but this heat should be nothing to a black ball.

167
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:31,360
What's wrong?

168
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:32,580
Do you want to get out already?

169
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:34,320
No, of course not!

170
00:09:34,340 --> 00:09:35,200
I can stay in!

171
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,140
I'm not done yet!

172
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:43,600
Over there's where the women's rooms are!

173
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:46,120
If a guy goes in, the trap magic will kill him!

174
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:47,460
Wow, serious security!

175
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:48,980
And here is...

176
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:49,160
Huh?

177
00:09:49,300 --> 00:09:49,940
The bathroom!

178
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:50,820
Ah!

179
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:51,980
You're dead.

180
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,660
We're really sorry, sir!

181
00:09:56,660 --> 00:09:57,180
Whoa!

182
00:09:57,340 --> 00:09:58,120
What's in there?

183
00:09:58,460 --> 00:09:59,900
That's the Beast Room.

184
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:01,080
Uh, what for?

185
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,320
It's Yami's little hobby.

186
00:10:04,060 --> 00:10:04,720
And Austin?

187
00:10:05,020 --> 00:10:05,340
Yeah?

188
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:06,120
What's up?

189
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:10,240
I've decided to put you in charge of our furry friends.

190
00:10:10,620 --> 00:10:10,860
What?

191
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:13,300
This job is an honor to have, you know?

192
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:16,220
I hate to give it up, but it's yours.

193
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:18,220
They get fed in the morning and in the evening.

194
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:19,840
Go on, give it a shot.

195
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,280
Okay, nice little beasties.

196
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:24,320
Here you go.

197
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:25,280
Eat up!

198
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:26,440
Ah!

199
00:10:26,780 --> 00:10:27,080
Ah!

200
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:31,020
The Black Bull's library!

201
00:10:31,300 --> 00:10:31,800
Got it!

202
00:10:32,540 --> 00:10:34,360
And this beauty here's the rec room.

203
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,000
You can have lots of fun in here.

204
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:36,340
Uh-huh!

205
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,200
Say what now?

206
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:37,560
Ah!

207
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:40,980
What's the matter, newbie?

208
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:42,000
Can't keep up?

209
00:10:42,140 --> 00:10:42,780
Just wait!

210
00:10:42,900 --> 00:10:44,260
You haven't seen anything yet!

211
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:44,600
Ha!

212
00:10:44,780 --> 00:10:45,740
I'll show you!

213
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:46,660
Ah!

214
00:10:46,780 --> 00:10:47,180
Ah!

215
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:48,560
Ow!

216
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:50,460
Geez, give a guy some warning.

217
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:51,160
What the?

218
00:10:54,460 --> 00:10:55,480
Who is she?

219
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,040
A Black Bull's robe.

220
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:58,380
So that means...

221
00:10:58,380 --> 00:10:59,400
Well, what do you know?

222
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,840
It's your fellow rookie.

223
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:03,160
She's our other new member this year.

224
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:03,900
Cool!

225
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:05,000
Another newbie?

226
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:06,540
Glad to know I'm not alone!

227
00:11:06,860 --> 00:11:07,580
How's it going?

228
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,080
I'm Asta from Hodge Village!

229
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,080
Let's give this all we've got!

230
00:11:11,540 --> 00:11:12,240
What do you say?

231
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:18,640
Don't speak to me so casually!

232
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:22,680
You're a little insect of a commoner, with barely any mana.

233
00:11:23,260 --> 00:11:24,140
Little insect!

234
00:11:24,380 --> 00:11:25,840
Gee, commoner?

235
00:11:26,340 --> 00:11:30,420
My name is Noelle Silva, of the Royal Silva House.

236
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:30,800
What?

237
00:11:30,860 --> 00:11:31,580
No way!

238
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,240
Are you...

239
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:34,580
Royalty!

240
00:11:34,580 --> 00:11:46,500
I, uh...

241
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:50,940
An insignificant insect like me should never have presumed to speak so informally to

242
00:11:50,940 --> 00:11:52,800
an exalted royal such as yourself!

243
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:56,140
As long as you understand.

244
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:57,280
Wait.

245
00:11:57,980 --> 00:11:59,520
Who are you calling a little insect?

246
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:02,700
We joined the Magic Knights at the same time, didn't we?

247
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:04,520
Who cares if you're royalty?

248
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,180
Yeah, that's right, Asuka!

249
00:12:06,260 --> 00:12:06,940
You kill her!

250
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,900
Being royal doesn't matter here!

251
00:12:09,780 --> 00:12:11,460
It does very much so.

252
00:12:11,500 --> 00:12:13,060
And what makes you so sure?

253
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:14,080
Ah...

254
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,840
Foolish commoners.

255
00:12:16,180 --> 00:12:18,640
I suppose words aren't enough to make you understand.

256
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:22,560
The difference in our magic power should get the point across.

257
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:23,880
Hey!

258
00:12:28,340 --> 00:12:29,160
Wait a minute!

259
00:12:32,300 --> 00:12:34,260
Don't forget your place again!

260
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:37,680
There's no time!

261
00:12:49,680 --> 00:12:51,120
What were you thinking?

262
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:52,580
Entitled brat.

263
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,140
Obviously you've got more guts than sense.

264
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,340
You just attacked a senior member!

265
00:12:57,840 --> 00:13:00,440
It isn't my fault you were in the wrong place.

266
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:02,240
I didn't tell you to stand there.

267
00:13:02,380 --> 00:13:03,480
You did that on your own.

268
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:07,920
What kind of crazy are you?

269
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:09,960
I'm your superior here!

270
00:13:10,660 --> 00:13:12,300
That's nice, but I'm royalty.

271
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:13,180
Yeah?

272
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:18,180
Well, I don't care if you're royalty or the sister of the Silver Eagle's captain!

273
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:23,400
Yami's the only person I know who would ever take on a crazy chick like you!

274
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:25,400
So you might want to show some gratitude.

275
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:30,960
